      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: Showcase of all available dialogue effects! Type without the "\"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <\shake><shake> is a short shake. Ignore the vine boom.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <\start_shake><start_shake> will make the shaking keep going...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: Until <\end_shake><end_shake> is called.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: <\flash> <flash>will make the screen flash.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[5]'
      value: similar to start_shake, <\start_flash><start_flash>will maintain the
        flashing...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[6]'
      value: Until <\end_flash><end_flash> is called.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[7]'
      value: We also have <\dim><dim>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[8]'
      value: As well as <\start_dim><start_dim> AAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3392612049195102056, guid: b344d6e93f1d24655a8a05fd4f9c94ec, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[9]'
