      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: "they were so loud, me and the others all looked at each other like,
        <i>\u201CWow, are you hearing this?\u201D</i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: What they were talking about flew over my head because they kept using
        big words, but it was <i>really</i> serious.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
