    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.character2
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -3929998360153519, guid: 7768e6cd5d1d84ba3b1a2c94654bef5d, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.soundToPlay
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cfd43b09479e4b35a0341f36b492e9b, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linksToOtherDialogue
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: playClosingAnimation
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: mainCharacterIsSpeaking
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_concerned>W-what? Ah, yes. Do you remember the manuscript?
        The page that I found the bookmark in was opened to a page about the salakab
        and more of his writings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: According to it, the salakab has the ability to <b>reveal hidden messages</b>
        if used properly.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: "<i>(Well, there were scribbles in it as well, but there were only flowery
        verses that I surely believe is Servillano\u2019s doing. The same way he
        captured my sister\u2019s heart.)</i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: <i>(Although, there were peculiar symbols that Ate Lorena must have
        written. Now that I think about it, those two ideas do not connect at all.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[4]'
      value: <i>(Could those actually mean something in terms that only they know
        about?)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: objectsToActivateAfter.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: objectsToDeactivateAfter.Array.size
